WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.071
JAMIE: True. It's built for professional
work — visual understanding, automated
computer tasks

00:00:04.071 --> 00:00:08.142
JAMIE: — not the hardest reasoning
problems. But honestly? Most real-world
tasks aren't

00:00:08.142 --> 00:00:12.213
JAMIE: the hardest reasoning problems.

00:00:12.393 --> 00:00:14.530
ALEX: Rufus, take us on location.

00:00:16.522 --> 00:00:20.748
RUFUS: Picture the trading floor. Not
the cinematic one — the real one,

00:00:20.748 --> 00:00:24.974
RUFUS: quieter, mostly monitors. When
OpenAI announced Terra on October
twenty-sixth, the number

00:00:24.974 --> 00:00:29.200
RUFUS: that landed with infrastructure
buyers wasn't the benchmark. It was
fifty percent.

00:00:29.200 --> 00:00:33.426
RUFUS: Because the pricing cut is what
matters most here —
